 "lore": {
  "intro": "The Long Gallery. Two service corridors,\nfour crossings. Everyone agrees on that.\nEveryone who walked it southside.",
  "radio": [
   {
    "trigger": "start",
    "text": "Ratio: Gallery run. South corridor to the far end, come back along the north."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "enter_room:2",
    "text": "Ratio: North side. Count the crossings for me, would you? I have four on file."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "enter_room:3",
    "text": "Ratio: Crossing one. There's a cardkey pinging in there \u2014 which is strange, because from the north wall, there is no crossing one."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "pickup:blue",
    "text": "Ratio: The attending's cardkey. The vault bolt answers it. Commando \u2014 the notes say what's in that vault isn't ours."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "exit",
    "text": "Ratio: Your arm. Is it\u2014 okay. We'll call it equipment. Equipment doesn't hum, but we'll call it that."
   }
  ],
  "terminals": [
   {
    "room": 1,
    "pos": [
     699.2,
     295.0
    ],
    "text": "GRAFFITI, scratched into the panel:\n4 GOING  3 BACK\n4 GOING  3 BACK\n4 GOING  3 BACK\nover and over, forty times."
   },
   {
    "room": 7,
    "pos": [
     380.0,
     445.0
    ],
    "text": "MEDICAL BAY (RELOCATED)\nPatient: unnamed, found in Gallery.\nImplant of unknown design fused to left arm.\nPatient states the implant 'came through the wall.'\nPatient discharged. Implant retained: vault,\nquarantine bolt thrown, release on the\nattending's cardkey only.\nAddendum: attending reports the cardkey lost on\ngallery rounds. Search of all four crossings\nfound three."
   },
   {
    "room": 0,
    "pos": [
     -80.0,
     215.0
    ],
    "text": "POSTED NOTICE, GALLERY ENTRANCE\nGALLERY CLOSED PENDING STRUCTURAL REVIEW.\n[handwritten beneath, several different hands]\n\u2014 review complete, corridor safe, opening today.\n\u2014 then why does it still say four on the\n  manifest and I count three.\n\u2014 because you walked it the way everyone walks\n  it. Try backward.\n\u2014 did. still three. still four. going to log it\n  and go get lunch."
   },
   {
    "room": 6,
    "pos": [
     635.0,
     100.0
    ],
    "text": "BREAK LOG, CROSSING FOUR\nNothing to report. Nothing to report. Nothing to\nreport. Relief crew: bring cards.\n[later, different hand]\nSomething to report. See crossing one. Do not\nlinger here either, just in case whatever's wrong\nwith one isn't done counting."
   },
   {
    "room": 2,
    "pos": [
     380.0,
     -95.0
    ],
    "text": "STRUCTURAL NOTE, GALLERY MIDPOINT\nFour load-bearing crossings, per the original\ndrawings. Fieldwork confirms three, walking\nnorth.\nRecommendation: trust the drawings; they were\nmade before anyone walked it drunk on double\nshifts.\nSecond recommendation, struck through but still\nlegible: the walking is probably right. Filed\nunder morale. Moving on."
   }
  ]
 },
